      "mergeID": "655b7d347c1d1555ef5b2ca4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When entering a vehicle, the avatar appears to increase in size, despite the height value not changing in expressions menu. Your eye view stays the same, but your avatar appears larger and hunched over. I've noticed this effect in the worlds \"Waluigi Pinball (mk8d）\" By REAL FREDDY236 and in \"Lightcycle arena\" By MyroP. I've also noticed the same effect happens in \"Dead Men Walking\" By Jar even though the world doesn't contain any vehicles. After you play a game, die, and are sent back to the starting area the avatar is affected in the same way.\n\nResetting the avatar in the expressions menu does fix the issue, but of course also loses any toggles and sliders that have been set in the menu too.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Vehicles and games break avatar scale",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "65581471e4fb2793b1a4265d",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
