      "mergeID": "655cd0de54df2256a68af5b4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Going to any world that changes the avatar height seems to break the avatars. Here's a screenshot from Laserdome, when pressing Start, Reset or getting hit, but that also happened on iY MMD and MMD home when playing an animation. When that happens, only the avatar change fixes it temporarily. The included screenshot shows my POV when that happens.\n\nEDIT: seats also seem to do that and I've added a screenshot too",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Worlds with avatar scale changing breaks the avatars",
