      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've done some similar testing with several avatars and can corroborate with what Fizzytaco has reported.\n\nI can confirm this issue only happens to avatars that have both the Gesture and FX layers set to Write Defaults ON.\n\nI did find a temporary solution: If you change the Gesture layer of your avatar to Write Defaults OFF, it will fix the problem and your avatar will not be affected by this scaling bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
