      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Did a few tests today with some avatars that were affected by the scaling bug earlier (those that have Write Defaults On in both the Gesture and FX layers) and it appears the scaling issue has been taken care of; the avatars do not appear big when entering the VRCStation and after leaving the station.\n\nTested them using the seats in the Avatar Testing Chamber and the dance pad in the MMD world.\n\nThe pictures below featured one of the avatars that were once affected by the bug (I did not change anything on her beforehand in Unity).",
